# Learn: lesson 1 (Serve a guest) completed with the table 1 key — the
# lesson step in the Objective drawer, the bell, "Lesson complete!" — then
# the results card, Play again, and lesson 2 (Stock up) through the station
# panel's Pick up and Serve buttons.
until 300 ▶ Play
frames 5
click ▶ Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 5
save modes
click Learn
until 60 Serve a guest
frames 5
save learn
click Serve a guest
frames 170
click Objective
until 30 Serve the waiting guest.
frames 5
save lesson-step
key Digit1 2
until 400 Total
expect Lesson complete!
frames 150
save lesson-results
frames 5
click Home
until 60 ▶ Play
frames 5
click ▶ Play
until 60 Learn
frames 5
click Learn
until 60 Stock up
frames 5
click Stock up
frames 170
click Stations
until 30 Kitchen — 1 dish(es) ready
frames 5
save stations
click Pick up
until 200 Tray: 1/2
frames 5
click Serve
until 400 Total
